{
  "_comment": [
    "Add a feed by appending an object with a name and url. Everything else is optional:",
    "  category  groups the source in the filter panel (default: 'News')",
    "  color     the avatar colour (default: derived from the name, stable across runs)",
    "  enabled   set false to keep a feed configured but out of the build (default: true)",
    "Both RSS 2.0 and Atom are handled. Restart the server or re-run build.py to pick up changes."
  ],

